# {{ api.title }}

A FastAPI service generated by [Euron Open APIForge](https://github.com/euron-sde-team/euron-open-apiforge)
{{ version }} from the OpenAPI spec "{{ api.title }}" {{ api.version }}. It runs as soon as it
is installed: every operation answers with example data that matches the spec, until you
write the handler.

## Run it

```bash
uv sync
uv run uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```

Open http://localhost:8000/docs for Swagger UI (or `/redoc`). `make check` runs everything
CI runs: ruff, mypy and the tests.

`uv sync` writes `uv.lock`, which pins every dependency: commit it. CI and the Docker image
then install exactly that set (`uv sync --locked`) and fail when it is out of date; without
it they still work but resolve the latest allowed versions.
{% if options.docker %}

With Docker: `docker compose up --build`.
{% if options.db %}
The image carries the migrations: in production (`APP_ENV=production`, where tables are
not created at startup) run `docker compose run --rm api /srv/.venv/bin/alembic upgrade head`
before starting the API.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}

## What is yours, what is generated

| Path | Owner | |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `app/handlers/` | **you** | One module per tag, one function per operation. Write your logic here. |
| `app/auth.py` | **you** | How credentials are checked (safe defaults read from settings). |
| `app/config.py` | **you** | Settings from environment variables; refuses unsafe production settings. |
| `app/main.py` | **you** | The entry point: middleware and extra setup. |
| `app/generated/` | APIForge | Models, routes, security, examples. Rewritten on every generation. |
| `tests/generated/` | APIForge | A contract test per operation, plus a check that the app serves its spec. |

APIForge never overwrites your files. When you regenerate after changing the spec, it
rewrites `app/generated/` and `tests/generated/`, appends a stub to the handler module for
every new operation, and tells you about operations that were removed. `apiforge.lock`
records what was generated, so a hand edit under `app/generated/` is detected instead of
being overwritten.

```bash
apiforge generate --spec openapi.yaml --output .
```

